    <string name="permission_contacts_title">Access to contacts is needed</string>
    <string name="permission_contacts_body">Speed Contact reads your contacts\' names, numbers and photos to show them in your home screen widgets, and reads them again in the background, even when the app is closed, to keep the widgets up to date. This data stays on your phone: the app has no internet access and sends it nowhere.</string>
    <string name="permission_call_title">Direct calling permission</string>
    <string name="permission_call_body">To start a call as soon as you tap a person, the app needs permission to make phone calls. It only calls when you tap, and it does not read your call log. Without this permission, the phone app opens so you can place the call yourself.</string>
